    "**My Algorithmic approaches:**\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Logistic Regression - Trained on TF-IDF word and character n-gram features.\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Linear SVM - Linear-kernel SVM trained on TF-IDF word and character features.\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Feed-Forward Neural Network (FFNN) - Implemented in PyTorch with three hidden layers and uses TF-IDF vectors as input.\n",
    "\n",
    "4. POS-Based Random Forest - Uses POS tag sequences, POS bigrams, and POS trigrams extracted with NLTK and focuses on writing style and grammatical patterns.\n",
    "\n",
    "5. Nonlinear SVM (RBF) - Combines TF-IDF, POS features, stylistic features, and tweet metadata. Designed to capture both content and author-specific behavior.\n",
    "\n",
    "6. BERTweet - Fine-tuned transformer model (vinai/bertweet-base). Pretrained on Twitter data and adapted for our authorship attribution task."
   ]
